<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Bad Breath</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Necromancer (guild level 16)
Mana: 18
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast bad breath &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast bad breath</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster cups a hand, utters 'Cumus entahc', and breathes a choking 
cloud of foul breath over the target. The better your divine power and 
your poison sphere, the more it hurts. A cloud seeps through clothes and 
leather easily and much less through chain and plate, and a shield is no 
use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
